        "Description": [
            {
                "value": "This research project aims to investigate long-term population dynamics and trends in carabids with a special focus on the lowland beech forests of Schorfheide-Chorin Biosphere Reserve. The researchers work with continuous fine-scale time series data as well as with a large-scale repeated survey. Other aspects of the project focus on the improvement of methods used to investigate trends in insect populations.",
